ROUTE dance0__Tall_and_Short_pos0.value_changed TO dad_lineoftext.set_translation
ROUTE dance0__Tall_and_Short.fraction_changed TO dance0__Tall_and_Short_scl0.set_fraction
ROUTE dance0__Tall_and_Short_scl0.value_changed TO dad_lineoftext.set_scale
ROUTE dance0__Tall_and_Short.isActive TO Script_dance0__Tall_and_Short.activated

ROUTE dance0__Tall_and_Short.cycleTime TO Script_dance0__Tall_and_Short.cycle

ROUTE Animation20.isActive TO Script_Animation20.activated

ROUTE Animation20.cycleTime TO Script_Animation20.cycle

ROUTE Script_Animation20.triggerStart TO Script_dance0__Tall_and_Short.startAt0
